      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "TensorRT LLM VisualGen accelerates inference on NVIDIA Blackwell GPUs with NVFP4 quantization, fused PrimsTS GEMM kernels, and torch.compile, delivering up to 1.62x faster text-to-image and 1.58x faster image-to-image generation over BF16 on a single B200.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/speed-up-image-generation-with-flux-3-image-klein-on-nvidia-blackwell-gpus/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T22:20:20.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:56.294Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "FLUX 3 Image Klein is an image editing and generation model from Black Forest Labs (BFL) trained on NVIDIA GB200 NVL72 and optimized for NVIDIA GPUs.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/speed-up-image-generation-with-flux-3-image-klein-on-nvidia-blackwell-gpus/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T22:20:20.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:56.294Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "This tutorial shows how to configure FLUX 3 Image Klein in NVIDIA TensorRT LLM VisualGen to take advantage of fused kernels, multi-GPU parallelism, FP8/NVFP4 support, caching, and attention optimizations.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/speed-up-image-generation-with-flux-3-image-klein-on-nvidia-blackwell-gpus/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T22:20:20.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:56.294Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In the reported 2048×2048 tests on a single NVIDIA B200 GPU, combined optimizations delivered up to 3.46x faster text-to-image (T2I) and 4.45x faster image-to-image (I2I) generation for FLUX 3 Image Klein Base compared with uncompiled BF16 inference.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/speed-up-image-generation-with-flux-3-image-klein-on-nvidia-blackwell-gpus/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T22:20:20.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:56.294Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "FLUX 3 Image Klein combines Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct for text conditioning, a diffusion transformer (DiT) to refine image latents, and an autoencoder to decode latents into images and encode I2I reference inputs.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/speed-up-image-generation-with-flux-3-image-klein-on-nvidia-blackwell-gpus/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T22:20:20.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:56.294Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "On an NVIDIA Blackwell GPU, NVFP4 delivered up to 1.62x faster T2I and 1.58x faster I2I generation than BF16.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/speed-up-image-generation-with-flux-3-image-klein-on-nvidia-blackwell-gpus/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T22:20:20.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:56.294Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "FLUX 3 Image Klein pipeline latency on NVIDIA B200",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/speed-up-image-generation-with-flux-3-image-klein-on-nvidia-blackwell-gpus/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T22:20:20.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:56.294Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "VisualGen supports BFL’s prequantized NVFP4 DiT checkpoints for FLUX 3 Image Klein and FLUX 3 Image Klein Base .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/speed-up-image-generation-with-flux-3-image-klein-on-nvidia-blackwell-gpus/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T22:20:20.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:56.294Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The optimizations and results in this post focus on NVIDIA Blackwell data center GPUs and NVIDIA RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell Server Edition GPUs.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/speed-up-image-generation-with-flux-3-image-klein-on-nvidia-blackwell-gpus/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-06T22:20:20.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:56.294Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The timestep cutoff of 0.96 keeps the first 12 denoising steps dense for 50-step FLUX 3 Image Klein Base and the first four steps dense for 16-step distilled Klein under the packaged α=6.93 schedule.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/speed-up-image-generation-with-flux-3-image-klein-on-nvidia-blackwell-gpus/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
